{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035010/extras/20c2a601336740f870bb3ed5f2cad361.avif?t=1769281994\" width=1149 height=185 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Team\u3011<br>This is a tower defense indie game developed by a core duo with additional support. Everyone worked on it part-time over the course of more than a year. Due to limited resources, the game may have its imperfections, but it represents our best effort under the circumstances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035010/extras/37ba333cad158e96a24a940dd7426a56.avif?t=1769281994\" width=1280 height=484 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Worldview\u3011<br>Set in the ancient Chinese underworld, every character\u2014from the Soup Attendants (towers) to the Souls (enemies)\u2014has a reason for being there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035010/extras/0dbab0b80d5e139fd039c3f67378bffd.avif?t=1769281994\" width=1371 height=421 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Gameplay\u3011<br>In this game, players can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instantly alter paths using anchor points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build towers freely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brew the Pot of Oblivion with herbs to enhance tower stats and effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place talisman traps along paths to aid in defense.<br>Various map sizes, initial path challenges, and obstacles with different effects will test your strategic planning.<br>There\u2019s even more to discover\u2014we invite you to experience it for yourself!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4035010?t=1769281994","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035010/12f020510359ec9e44c11a8ecefde451d3ee8a2b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769281994","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035010/8c903b869310aa15f02d721099a329c9a8e3b738/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769281994","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035010/8c903b869310aa15f02d721099a329c9a8e3b738/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769281994","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4318600,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035010/extras/20c2a601336740f870bb3ed5f2cad361.avif?t=1769281994\" width=1149 height=185 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Team\u3011<br>This is a tower defense indie game developed by a core duo with additional support. Everyone worked on it part-time over the course of more than a year. Due to limited resources, the game may have its imperfections, but it represents our best effort under the circumstances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035010/extras/37ba333cad158e96a24a940dd7426a56.avif?t=1769281994\" width=1280 height=484 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Worldview\u3011<br>Set in the ancient Chinese underworld, every character\u2014from the Soup Attendants (towers) to the Souls (enemies)\u2014has a reason for being there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035010/extras/0dbab0b80d5e139fd039c3f67378bffd.avif?t=1769281994\" width=1371 height=421 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Gameplay\u3011<br>In this game, players can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instantly alter paths using anchor points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build towers freely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brew the Pot of Oblivion with herbs to enhance tower stats and effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place talisman traps along paths to aid in defense.<br>Various map sizes, initial path challenges, and obstacles with different effects will test your strategic planning.<br>There\u2019s even more to discover\u2014we invite you to experience it for yourself!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["\u5f7c\u5cb8\u5fd8\u6182\u5de5\u4f5c\u5ba4"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035010/e4f35ec24f477c99b88915291138ae87917577ef/header.jpg?t=1769281994","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4035010/1957604345/1e46bdcd23c4dc4c823201f412745d71a173159c/1769097912/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769098977","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4035010/1957604345/1e4